# Regenerable build artifacts — everything here can be rebuilt from the tracked
# plan (BRIEF / STORYBOARD / SCRIPT / frame.md) plus assets/.

# Headless crawl of the app — re-run `npx hyperframes capture http://localhost:5174`
capture/

# Review contact sheets — re-run `npx hyperframes snapshot`
snapshots/
.thumbnails/

# TTS working copies + voice audition takes; the shipped VO lives in assets/voice/
.media/

# Assets the assembler re-stages out of capture/ on every build (duplicates of
# assets/frames/*.png, which is what the compositions actually reference)
assets/*-frame.png

node_modules/
